							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16784#msg16784"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16784#msg16784">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2839 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 09:15:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Honestly it has nothing to do with the guilds or guilds leadership, it has to do with the players themselves knowing better and not giving a shit. This game is beyond blaming the guild or it&#039;s leaders. A player is going to do what they want reguardless of what guild they are in. My bet is every guild has some assholes that like to screw other people over for personal gain and really don&#039;t care about you at all or what you have to say about them. If they did they wouldn&#039;t screw you over in the first place.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
